# What never reaches a docker build whose context is the repository root
# (Dockerfile, e2e/docker/*/Dockerfile): the git history, built packages and
# module caches, node_modules, a demo's state, TLS material.  Every COPY in
# those Dockerfiles names source under admin/, nginx-module/, docker/, e2e/,
# snippets/ or tools/; nothing below is wanted, and a local artifact that
# happened to sit in the tree could never be copied in by mistake.
.git
dist
build
rpmbuild
demo
data
tls
**/node_modules
*.rpm
*.deb
*.apk
*.so
*.sqlite
*.db
